          "text": "Témoignages: COSNE-COURS-SUR-LOIRE (58) 05.07.2014",
          "text_sha256": "165ee0fe9ddc4fe1207de8bd5cfe23d30a1d2e7d7b21b23e59794fe2b16b48aa"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
